cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tool in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "AETG-Validate: Phi-gated IDS evasion validation with confidence intervals"
abstract: >-
  A command-line tool that measures IDS and ML-NIDS evasion rates only on
  functionally valid network traffic, reporting every rate with a 95 % Wilson
  confidence interval and a verifiable integrity digest.
